.TH WIFI-HOTSPOT-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "Wi-Fi Relay" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wifi-hotspot-settings \- configure and manage a GNOME Wi-Fi hotspot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wifi-hotspot-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the GTK4 preferences application to configure hotspot credentials,
network interfaces, frequency band, and client isolation, and view clients.
The system daemon can share an existing Wi-Fi connection through a virtual
access point if the wireless hardware and driver support concurrent AP+STA.
If necessary, startup switches the existing connection to a reachable
2.4 GHz access point with the same SSID on a permitted hotspot channel.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/wifi-hotspot.conf
System hotspot configuration. Set WIFI_IFACE and INTERNET_IFACE to the
appropriate interfaces before starting the hotspot.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nmcli (1),
.BR iw (8),
.BR hostapd (8)
